Successfully completed the practical exploration of AWS cloud services using Oracle VirtualBox, Ubuntu Linux, AWS Management Console, and AWS CloudShell. Gained practical knowledge of cloud storage, identity and access management, virtual machines, networking, monitoring, and basic AWS CLI operations.
